==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*15 [[Snache]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*18 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ren Katagiri (Enemy)|Ren Katagiri]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

